<?page title="Grid Layout Utilities" contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8"?>
<zk xmlns:h="native">
<div sclass="z-p-8">
    <label value="Grid Layout Utilities" sclass="z-h2 z-mb-2"/>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-8">
        Marble ships three layout utilities, all built on native CSS Grid, aligned with MD3/MUI, and most needing <h:b>no breakpoints</h:b>.
        This page goes from simple to advanced: basic usage first, then real enterprise scenarios (not limited to this project). Resize the browser wider and narrower to watch each block respond.
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <!-- PART 1 — basics -->
    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-h4 z-mt-4 z-mb-4">Part 1 · Basics</div>

    <!-- 1.1 z-grid-fill   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">1.1 · z-grid-fill — cards auto-fill and wrap</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            The column count <h:b>grows and shrinks with the container width</h:b>; each card is at least <h:code>--zk-grid-min</h:code> (default 180px) wide and wraps when it no longer fits.
            Ideal for <h:b>independent</h:b> card walls, dashboard tiles, and product lists. <h:b>Zero breakpoints</h:b>.
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4 z-mb-3">
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">Card 1</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">Card 2</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">Card 3</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">Card 4</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">Card 5</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">Card 6</div>
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><label multiline="true" pre="true"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4">
    <div class="z-card">Card 1</div>
    <div class="z-card">Card 2</div>
    ...
</div>
<!-- want wider cards: style="--zk-grid-min: 240px" -->]]></label></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.2 z-grid-cols-auto   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">1.2 · z-grid-cols-auto — a label column + N aligned columns</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            The first column is <h:code>auto</h:code> (sized to its content, for labels) plus N equal-width columns that <h:b>fill</h:b> the rest, with <h:code>--zk-cols</h:code> controlling the count.
            The point is <h:b>alignment across rows</h:b>: the same column lines up on every row. Ideal for comparison tables, spec sheets, and matrices.
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3 z-mb-3" style="--zk-cols: 3">
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">Col A</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">Col B</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">Col C</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Row 1</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">A1</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">B1</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">C1</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Row 2</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">A2</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">B2</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-py-2 z-text-center">C2</div>
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><label multiline="true" pre="true"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3" style="--zk-cols: 3">
    <div></div>   <div>Col A</div> <div>Col B</div> <div>Col C</div>  <!-- header -->
    <div>Row 1</div> <div>A1</div>  <div>B1</div>  <div>C1</div>      <!-- data row -->
    <div>Row 2</div> <div>A2</div>  <div>B2</div>  <div>C2</div>
</div>
<!-- all cells are direct children of one grid; every (1+N) cells wrap to the next row -->]]></label></div>
        <div sclass="z-bg-secondary-container z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-mt-3">
            <h:b>Why it aligns</h:b>: every cell above lives in <h:b>one grid</h:b>, so the <h:code>auto</h:code> label column is measured once from the widest label across all rows and stays aligned.
            If each row is wrapped in <h:b>its own separate wrapper</h:b> (e.g. a per-row template each in its own div), every row computes its own <h:code>auto</h:code> column width and <h:b>falls out of alignment</h:b>;
            set the wrapper to <h:code>display: contents</h:code> to flatten it back into a single grid (or use <h:code>grid-template-columns: subgrid</h:code>) to realign. The preview's State Matrix does exactly this with <h:code>display: contents</h:code>.
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.3 z-grid-cols-N   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">1.3 · z-grid-cols-N — a fixed N equal-width columns</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">
            The simplest <h:b>fixed column count</h:b> (1–6): equal-width columns that fill the row and never wrap. Ideal for "I just want N columns" layouts like form-field alignment.
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-3 z-gap-3 z-mb-3">
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">1 / 3</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">2 / 3</div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center">3 / 3</div>
        </div>
        <div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-p-3 z-text-sm z-overflow-x-auto"><label multiline="true" pre="true"><![CDATA[<div class="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-3 z-gap-3"> ... </div>]]></label></div>
    </div>

    <!-- 1.4 which to choose (laid out with z-grid-cols-auto itself — dogfood)   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-3">1.4 · Which one to choose?</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-3">(This comparison table is itself laid out with <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> + <h:code>--zk-cols: 2</h:code>.)</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3" style="--zk-cols: 2">
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">Column behavior</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary">Best for</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">z-grid-fill</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Grows / shrinks with width, wraps</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Independent card walls, dashboard tiles</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">z-grid-cols-auto</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Fixed N cols + auto label col, aligned across rows</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Comparison tables, spec sheets, matrices</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">z-grid-cols-N</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Fixed N cols, no label col</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Form-field alignment</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <!-- PART 2 — enterprise use cases -->
    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-h4 z-mt-4 z-mb-4">Part 2 · Enterprise scenarios</div>

    <!-- 2.1 SaaS pricing plan comparison   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.1 · SaaS pricing plan comparison</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">Tool: <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> + <h:code>--zk-cols: 3</h:code>. Each feature row keeps the plan columns aligned; the last row holds the CTA buttons.</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3 z-align-center" style="--zk-cols: 3">
            <div/>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center"><div sclass="z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface">Free</div><div sclass="z-text-2xl z-fw-bold z-text-primary">$0</div><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary">/ mo</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center z-bg-primary-container"><div sclass="z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface">Pro</div><div sclass="z-text-2xl z-fw-bold z-text-primary">$29</div><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary">/ mo</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card z-text-center"><div sclass="z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface">Enterprise</div><div sclass="z-text-2xl z-fw-bold z-text-primary">Contact us</div><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary">Custom</div></div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2">Users</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2">3</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2">25</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2">Unlimited</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">Storage</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">5 GB</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">100 GB</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">1 TB</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">SSO / SAML</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">24/7 support</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-pt-3"/>
            <div sclass="z-pt-3 z-text-center"><button label="Choose" sclass="z-button-outlined"/></div>
            <div sclass="z-pt-3 z-text-center"><button label="Start trial"/></div>
            <div sclass="z-pt-3 z-text-center"><button label="Contact sales" sclass="z-button-outlined"/></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.2 cloud instance spec comparison   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.2 · Cloud instance spec comparison</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">Tool: <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> + <h:code>--zk-cols: 4</h:code>. A classic "spec rows × instance-type columns" two-dimensional comparison.</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3" style="--zk-cols: 4">
            <div/>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface z-text-center">t3.small</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface z-text-center">m5.large</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface z-text-center">c5.xlarge</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-fw-semibold z-text-on-surface z-text-center">r5.2xlarge</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">vCPU</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center">2</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center">2</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center">4</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center">8</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">Memory</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">2 GB</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">8 GB</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">8 GB</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">64 GB</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">Network</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">Low</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">Medium</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">High</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">10 Gbps</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">Price / hour</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">$0.02</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">$0.10</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">$0.17</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top">$0.50</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.3 operations KPI dashboard   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.3 · Operations KPI dashboard</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">Tool: <h:code>z-grid-fill</h:code>. Tiles are independent — more columns on wide screens, fewer on narrow ones — with no media queries at all.</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4" style="--zk-grid-min: 200px">
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary z-text-uppercase">Revenue (MTD)</div><div sclass="z-text-3xl z-fw-bold z-text-on-surface">$1.28M</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-success">▲ 12.4%</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary z-text-uppercase">Orders</div><div sclass="z-text-3xl z-fw-bold z-text-on-surface">8,431</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-success">▲ 3.1%</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary z-text-uppercase">New customers</div><div sclass="z-text-3xl z-fw-bold z-text-on-surface">512</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-error">▼ 1.8%</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-text-xs z-text-secondary z-text-uppercase">Conversion rate</div><div sclass="z-text-3xl z-fw-bold z-text-on-surface">4.7%</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-success">▲ 0.5%</div></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.4 product catalog card wall   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.4 · Product catalog card wall</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">Tool: <h:code>z-grid-fill</h:code> with a larger <h:code>--zk-grid-min: 240px</h:code>. E-commerce listings, media libraries, and people directories all take this shape.</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-fill z-gap-4" style="--zk-grid-min: 240px">
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-mb-3" style="height:96px"/><div sclass="z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">Wireless headphones</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Noise-cancelling · 30hr</div><div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-bold z-text-primary z-mt-2">$129</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-mb-3" style="height:96px"/><div sclass="z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">Mechanical keyboard</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Hot-swap · RGB</div><div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-bold z-text-primary z-mt-2">$89</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-mb-3" style="height:96px"/><div sclass="z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">4K monitor</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">27" · 144Hz</div><div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-bold z-text-primary z-mt-2">$349</div></div>
            <div sclass="z-card"><div sclass="z-bg-surface-variant z-rounded z-mb-3" style="height:96px"/><div sclass="z-fw-medium z-text-on-surface">Ergonomic chair</div><div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Mesh · adjustable</div><div sclass="z-text-lg z-fw-bold z-text-primary z-mt-2">$420</div></div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.5 system settings form   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.5 · System settings form</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">Tool: <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto-1fr</h:code> (the N=1 special case of <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code>). The label column is auto-width and the field fills the rest, keeping labels and inputs neatly aligned.</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto-1fr z-gap-3 z-align-center" style="max-width:560px">
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Display name</div>
            <textbox value="Acme Corp" hflex="1"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Contact email</div>
            <textbox value="admin@acme.com" hflex="1"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Time zone</div>
            <combobox value="UTC+08:00" hflex="1"/>
            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">Notifications</div>
            <checkbox label="Receive weekly digest" checked="true"/>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 2.6 role x permission matrix   -->
    <div sclass="z-mb-10">
        <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-uppercase z-text-secondary z-border-bottom z-pb-2 z-mb-1">2.6 · Role × permission matrix</div>
        <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-4">Tool: <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code> + <h:code>--zk-cols: 4</h:code>. Access control, feature entitlements, and compatibility charts are all this kind of check matrix.</div>
        <div sclass="z-d-grid z-grid-cols-auto z-gap-3" style="--zk-cols: 4">
            <div/>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary z-text-center">Viewer</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary z-text-center">Editor</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary z-text-center">Manager</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-xs z-fw-semibold z-text-secondary z-text-center">Admin</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary">View content</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-center z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">Edit content</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">Manage members</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>

            <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-pt-2 z-border-top">Billing / settings</div>
            <div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-disabled">—</div><div sclass="z-text-center z-pt-2 z-border-top z-text-success">✓</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================= -->
    <div sclass="z-h4 z-mt-4 z-mb-3">Summary</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-2">• <h:b>Independent cards</h:b> (no cross-row alignment) → <h:code>z-grid-fill</h:code>; tune the min card width with <h:code>--zk-grid-min</h:code>.</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-2">• <h:b>Label + N aligned columns</h:b> (comparison / spec / pricing / matrix) → <h:code>z-grid-cols-auto</h:code>; tune the column count with <h:code>--zk-cols</h:code>.</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-2">• <h:b>Just a fixed N columns</h:b> (form alignment) → <h:code>z-grid-cols-N</h:code>.</div>
    <div sclass="z-text-sm z-text-secondary z-mb-6">All three are built on native CSS Grid, and <h:code>minmax(0, …)</h:code> guarantees no horizontal overflow → no phantom scrollbars on mobile. See <h:code>doc/spec/responsive-design.md</h:code> for details.</div>
</div>
</zk>
